<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Artitude 2025: Creativity with a Cause!</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Inter Font -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f0f4f8; /* Light blue-gray background */
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: flex-start; /* Align to top for longer content */
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 2rem;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        /* Custom scrollbar for better aesthetics */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 8px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #94a3b8;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
            background: #64748b;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="p-4 md:p-8 bg-gray-100 min-h-screen">

    <div class="max-w-4xl w-full bg-white shadow-2xl rounded-xl p-6 md:p-10 lg:p-12 border border-gray-200">

        <!-- Header Section -->
        <header class="text-center mb-10">
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-blue-800 mb-3 leading-tight">
                Artitude 2025
            </h1>
            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-blue-600 font-semibold mb-6">
                🎨 Creativity with a Cause! 💡
            </h2>
            <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-700 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                Join us for a vibrant college-wide Arts Festival celebrating the power of art to inspire beauty and create social impact.
            </p>
        </header>

        <!-- Event Details Section -->
        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-10">
            <div class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md border border-blue-200">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-700 mb-3 flex items-center">
                    <span class="mr-2 text-2xl">🗓️</span> When
                </h3>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-800">Monday, June 30th</p>
                <p class="text-xl font-semibold text-blue-900">8:00 AM - 12:30 PM</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-purple-50 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md border border-purple-200">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-purple-700 mb-3 flex items-center">
                    <span class="mr-2 text-2xl">🏫</span> Where
                </h3>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-800">Temasek Junior College</p>
                <p class="text-md text-gray-600">(Various venues: Audi, Hall, LTs, Foyer, D Block, B Block)</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-green-50 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md border border-green-200">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-700 mb-3 flex items-center">
                    <span class="mr-2 text-2xl">👥</span> Who
                </h3>
                <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-lg text-gray-800">
                    <li>IP1-4, JC1 & JC2 Students</li>
                    <li>TJC Staff (from 9:00 AM)</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Schedule Section -->
        <section class="mb-10 bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md border border-gray-200">
            <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-6 text-center">
                ✨ Event Schedule ✨
            </h3>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-y-6 gap-x-8">

                <div class="flex items-start">
                    <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-lg mr-4 shadow-md">1</div>
                    <div>
                        <p class="font-semibold text-lg text-gray-900">8:00 AM - 8:40 AM</p>
                        <p class="text-gray-700">Morning Assembly</p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">(Audi for IP1-4, Hall for JC1 and JC2)</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex items-start">
                    <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-lg mr-4 shadow-md">2</div>
                    <div>
                        <p class="font-semibold text-lg text-gray-900">8:40 AM - 9:00 AM</p>
                        <p class="text-gray-700">IP CTs’ Check-in (Homerooms) & Transition time for JC1/JC2</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex items-start md:col-span-2">
                    <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-lg mr-4 shadow-md">3</div>
                    <div>
                        <p class="font-semibold text-lg text-gray-900">9:00 AM - 10:00 AM</p>
                        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 ml-2">
                            <li>JC Talentime @ Audi</li>
                            <li>Film Screening at LT1</li>
                            <li>Foyer: Performances or Lego Alive!</li>
                            <li>Art Chalk Decor (outside Guidance Hub)</li>
                            <li>Art Canvas Jamming (under Audi, near swings)</li>
                            <li>LT2: Origami & Crafts</li>
                            <li>LT3: Mosaic Tile Craft</li>
                            <li>Art Trail (OTOT, link provided)</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex items-start md:col-span-2">
                    <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-lg mr-4 shadow-md">4</div>
                    <div>
                        <p class="font-semibold text-lg text-gray-900">10:00 AM - 11:00 AM</p>
                        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 ml-2">
                            <li>IP Talentime @ Audi</li>
                            <li>Film Screening at LT1</li>
                            <li>Foyer: Performances or Lego Alive!</li>
                            <li>Art Chalk Decor (outside Guidance Hub)</li>
                            <li>Art Canvas Jamming (under Audi, near swings)</li>
                            <li>LT2: Origami & Crafts</li>
                            <li>LT3: Mosaic Tile Craft</li>
                            <li>Art Trail (OTOT, link provided)</li>
                            <li><span class="font-medium text-purple-700">Student-run workshops:</span> Crochet (B108), Macrame (B109), Flipbook (B107a), Shrink Plastic (B107b)</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex items-start md:col-span-2">
                    <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-lg mr-4 shadow-md">5</div>
                    <div>
                        <p class="font-semibold text-lg text-gray-900">11:00 AM - 12:00 PM</p>
                        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 ml-2">
                            <li>Film Screening at LT1</li>
                            <li>Foyer: Performances or Lego Alive!</li>
                            <li>Art Chalk Decor (outside Guidance Hub)</li>
                            <li>Art Canvas Jamming (under Audi, near swings)</li>
                            <li>LT2: Origami & Crafts</li>
                            <li>LT3: Mosaic Tile Craft</li>
                            <li>Art Trail (OTOT, link provided)</li>
                            <li><span class="font-medium text-green-700">Upcycling workshops at D block:</span> Handphone holder (D201, D202), Stationery Holder (D205, D206), Recyclable bag (D103, D104), Ragdoll (D101, D102), Paper Marche art (D203, D204)</li>
                            <li><span class="font-medium text-purple-700">Student-run workshops:</span> Crochet (B108), Macrame (B109), Flipbook (B107a), Shrink Plastic (B107b)</li>
                            <li>Alumni Band @ Audi (11:30 AM)</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex items-start">
                    <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-lg mr-4 shadow-md">6</div>
                    <div>
                        <p class="font-semibold text-lg text-gray-900">12:00 PM - 12:30 PM</p>
                        <p class="text-gray-700">Clean Up / Reflections & Survey</p>
                        <p class="text-md text-gray-600">Dismissal at 12:30 PM</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Important Notes Section -->
        <section class="bg-yellow-50 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md border border-yellow-200">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-yellow-700 mb-4 flex items-center justify-center">
                <span class="mr-2 text-2xl">⚠️</span> Important Notes
            </h3>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-lg text-gray-800 space-y-2">
                <li>TJC Staff can attend activities from 9:00 AM onwards.</li>
                <li>
                    **Dress Code:** Full uniform OR dress to the theme of 'Sustainability' or what best represents themselves as their TJ-ME Day outfit.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <footer class="text-center text-gray-500 mt-10 text-sm">
            <p>&copy; 2025 Artitude Festival. All rights reserved.</p>
        </footer>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
